print(arr_2d.size)     # 9 - total elements

# 3D Array (Tensor)
arr_3d = np.array([[[1, 2], [3, 4]],
                   [[5, 6], [7, 8]]])
print(arr_3d.shape)    # (2, 2, 2) - 2x2x2 structure
print(arr_3d.ndim)     # 3 - three dimensions
```
- **itemsize**: Size of each element in bytes
- **data**: Memory buffer

