# Boolean indexing (filtering)
mask = arr > 5
filtered = arr[mask]    # [6 7 8 9 10 11 12]

# Fancy indexing (integer arrays)
indices = [0, 2]
selected = arr[indices, :]  # Select rows 0 and 2
```

